@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
title HD — existing gate relationships
left to right direction
rectangle "Existing GAP-D01–GAP-D11 follow-up\nAuthority remains in accepted planning records" as Gaps
rectangle "Affected M-02/M-03 decisions\nInputs / access / resources / design / recovery / quality" as Design
rectangle "Before execution enablement / M-08\nActual safe supported execution + target controls" as Execution #FFF3DF
rectangle "Before M-09/M-10 readiness\nActual integrated / quality / restoration / live evidence" as Release #FFF3DF
rectangle "After analysis/design, before product coding\nWork / effort / live tracking reconciliation + agreed baseline" as Coding
Gaps --> Design : decisive findings
Gaps --> Execution : actual enabling controls
Gaps --> Release : later actual results
Gaps --> Coding : GAP-D05 / GAP-D11
note bottom of Design
Actual future release tests are not all prerequisites for drafting analysis.
M-01 remains accepted for its historical identified scope only.
No new milestone or completed milestone is created here.
end note

legend bottom
Qualified analysis/design input, not a selected architecture, accepted forecast or operational proof.
No coding, provider/host operation, live tracker update, spending or baseline acceptance performed.
endlegend
@enduml
